WEBVTT

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:16.390
Muranushi.

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.430
Who's this stuffy kid?

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:22.140
Stuffy?

00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:26.230
Oh, Kisaki, you don't remember?
That's Saitou.

00:00:26.230 --> 00:00:28.610
He works for Kamakura, apparently.

00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:32.240
So you're Kisaki Kondou?

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:33.360
Saitou?

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:35.570
You're smart, so you should remember.

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:37.700
Childhood Friends

00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:37.580
From elementary school...

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:44.290
Daichi Saitou, the kid who was always
teased on the way home.

00:00:44.790 --> 00:00:46.170
Yes, that's the one.

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:50.550
Even back then, you two were jerks!

00:02:23.470 --> 00:02:28.900
COOKING IS LOVE

00:02:23.890 --> 00:02:26.890
So you're the Saitou
who saw Muranushi smile.

00:02:26.890 --> 00:02:28.650
You do remember me!

00:02:28.650 --> 00:02:31.110
Kamakura's bodyguard, huh?

00:02:31.110 --> 00:02:33.980
Yuuta! Hey, Yuuta!

00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:38.150
Was the sushi you ate
a little while ago that good?

00:02:38.150 --> 00:02:41.370
Sushi with just a big load of wasabi
instead of fish...

00:02:41.370 --> 00:02:44.910
So you liked it, Yuuta? Hey, Yuuta?

00:02:44.910 --> 00:02:47.460
I don't think Kamakura needs a bodyguard.

00:02:47.460 --> 00:02:52.290
No, I'm that tall guy's bodyguard.
I don't care about the lady.

00:02:53.460 --> 00:02:54.880
Then why not help Shindou?

00:02:55.090 --> 00:02:57.510
According to the president's manual,

00:02:57.510 --> 00:03:01.590
"If you interfere too much with my daughter's
fun and she says something like, 'I hate Papa,'

00:03:01.590 --> 00:03:06.270
I would be devastated, so just observe unless
it becomes absolutely necessary to intervene."

00:03:07.270 --> 00:03:10.600
So unlike you,
I'm actually working really hard right now.

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:12.020
Go home.

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:15.440
Kisaki, after you're done washing dishes,
wipe them dry...

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:18.570
...is something you won't do,
so please tell...

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:20.570
Um... Hello.

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:23.280
<i>He smells just like me!</i>

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:30.460
He's an old classmate of Muranushi and me,
and now works for Kamakura. Daichi Saitou.

00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:31.750
Saitou...

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:37.210
<i>When Sayuri was in elementary school,
she smiled at a classmate, Saitou...</i>

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:39.590
I'm so glad you're okay...

00:03:39.590 --> 00:03:41.130
<i>He is the same as me!</i>

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:44.390
Then Sayuri Muranushi put you
through hell, too, huh?

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:49.100
"Hell"? I wouldn't go that far.

00:03:48.060 --> 00:03:49.730
Being Modest

00:03:52.770 --> 00:03:54.400
Traitor!

00:03:57.650 --> 00:03:59.780
Is Saitou abandoning his duties again?

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:04.780
It's not Muranushi's fault
that he can't find a proper full-time job.

00:04:04.780 --> 00:04:07.240
The fault lies within himself.

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:09.790
<i>I feel sorry for Saitou.</i>

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:15.170
<i>But why doesn't he just quit? Even if he works,
he'll just get bullied by Shiho and Muranushi.</i>

00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:17.380
It's so sad...

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:20.130
Well, there's no need for you to worry.

00:04:21.050 --> 00:04:23.590
I only bully you, Yuuta!

00:04:25.010 --> 00:04:26.760
Th-That's good?

00:04:26.760 --> 00:04:30.140
By the way, Yuuta...
When can you pay off your debt?

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:34.690
I'm paying you. Though a little at a time...

00:04:34.690 --> 00:04:38.400
That's right.
In all things, accumulation is important.

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:41.650
You have been paying me every month.

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:43.910
Though only the interest!

00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:45.200
Dammit all!

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:48.950
Oh my, Yuuta is abandoning his post, too?

00:04:49.450 --> 00:04:52.580
Dammit, that woman... Just you wait!

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:53.960
GRUMBLE RUMBLE

00:04:55.710 --> 00:04:57.670
I'm hungry...

00:04:57.670 --> 00:05:01.720
Although I can get the customers
at the host club to buy food for me...

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:08.260
What?

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:12.480
After looking at Shiho,
you look like an angel to me, Kisaki.

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:16.690
So if I can get some food—

00:05:16.690 --> 00:05:17.810
Shut up.

00:05:22.190 --> 00:05:23.110
Hime...

00:05:23.740 --> 00:05:25.820
Fine, Hime will do!
Please give me something!

00:05:26.280 --> 00:05:27.820
Don't mooch off of a baby.

00:05:30.620 --> 00:05:32.040
Those are lottery tickets?

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:37.250
She wants to play the stock market, but she's
too young, so I gave her those to play with.

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:39.420
Thank you, Hime...

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:44.760
Hime. Don't grow up to be a sugar mama
for a guy like this.

00:05:44.970 --> 00:05:47.930
A Few Days Later

00:05:49.010 --> 00:05:50.180
Kisaki...

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:53.890
What's wrong, Shindou?
Are you on the brink of starvation?

00:05:55.850 --> 00:05:58.020
L-Lottery ticket... Winner...

00:05:59.730 --> 00:06:01.360
Don't eat lottery tickets.

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:02.570
No, I didn't win food poisoning!

00:06:03.190 --> 00:06:06.530
The numbers do match up
for the grand prize, and other prizes.

00:06:06.990 --> 00:06:09.240
Kisaki, you sure are keeping your cool.

00:06:09.240 --> 00:06:12.790
This doesn't seem real to me, but this figure...

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:18.420
With 300 million yen, I could pay off Shiho
and she'll stop haunting me!

00:06:22.340 --> 00:06:24.920
It seems like you won quite a bit.

00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:29.760
<i>Calm down, me.
Take away the debt, and she and I are equals.</i>

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:31.350
<i>In fact, I've got a leg up!</i>

00:06:31.810 --> 00:06:36.310
Th-That's right,
so now I'll be able to pay off my debt...

00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:38.270
And then?

00:06:38.480 --> 00:06:40.020
Scary!

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:44.440
<i>B-But it'll be troublesome if I mess up
and she gets mad at me and holds a grudge.</i>

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:46.030
<i>I must be gentle.</i>

00:06:46.030 --> 00:06:49.530
Um... I've been a thorn in your side
for a long time now,

00:06:49.530 --> 00:06:51.660
and it looks like I can pay back the debt.

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:56.750
So you won't have to follow me
around anymore to collect on it, Shiho.

00:06:57.290 --> 00:07:01.040
Th-Thank you for everything... or something.

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:02.590
I see.

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:04.590
Good for you.

00:07:05.170 --> 00:07:06.300
Congratulations.

00:07:10.970 --> 00:07:11.970
Hey.

00:07:13.010 --> 00:07:14.260
<i>I won...</i>

00:07:14.430 --> 00:07:17.230
<i>...but I wonder why, I don't feel satisfied at all.</i>

00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:18.640
Shindou.

00:07:19.480 --> 00:07:21.650
Are you sure about this?

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:23.020
S-Sure about what?

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:26.610
You didn't even break a sweat,
and you got this money by chance.

00:07:26.610 --> 00:07:30.700
And, you made a girl cry, but your debt
will be paid back. Does that make you happy?

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:36.200
SWEAT

00:07:31.870 --> 00:07:36.200
<i>Kisaki doesn't regret
letting go of that lottery ticket, right?</i>

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:40.080
<i>I haven't seen her cry in a long time.</i>

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:41.330
<i>The last I saw it was...</i>

00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:45.840
<i>...when we were kids
and I recklessly rejected her.</i>

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:49.970
<i>After that, her personality suddenly changed.</i>

00:07:50.380 --> 00:07:54.470
<i>What if she becomes
even more terrifying after this...</i>

00:07:55.390 --> 00:07:56.560
That's right...

00:07:57.100 --> 00:07:59.270
I just want to protect myself!

00:07:59.270 --> 00:08:03.270
I definitely wasn't moved by her tears!
Get it together, me!

00:08:04.810 --> 00:08:06.980
Um... uh...

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:13.280
Kisaki, you must feel frustrated
since it was originally Hime's ticket, right?

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:18.200
It's too bad I can't frustrate Shiho, but it can't
be helped, so I'll give this back to you.

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:20.790
Do you think I'm a fool?

00:08:20.790 --> 00:08:23.880
You think I'm so small-minded
to take back something I gave you?

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:26.130
Crash!

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:28.170
You're overreacting.

00:08:28.710 --> 00:08:30.050
You, too.

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:35.760
Miyakoshi.

00:08:37.220 --> 00:08:40.560
Isn't it about time you at least greeted Saiki?

00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:43.600
Yeah, but I don't understand English.

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:46.060
"Hello" would be fine, just a simple "hello."

00:08:46.900 --> 00:08:47.980
Haro...

00:08:52.650 --> 00:08:54.950
Crap, Higashida!
I greeted him and he was like,

00:08:54.950 --> 00:08:59.200
"Oh, she wants to speak English,"
and then he hits me with a lot of it!

00:08:59.490 --> 00:09:02.250
To be honest, I suspected that might happen.

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:03.540
Bastard!

00:09:04.870 --> 00:09:06.540
How can I put this?

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:08.170
I don't know what the situation is,

00:09:08.170 --> 00:09:12.470
but even if the debt gets settled,
it's not like you two won't interact anymore.

00:09:12.470 --> 00:09:15.050
Without the debt, we wouldn't be interacting.

00:09:15.510 --> 00:09:18.510
Then use this opportunity
to communicate with him more honestly,

00:09:18.510 --> 00:09:20.310
then it won't be so bad, right?

00:09:21.850 --> 00:09:23.270
Is that any comfort?

00:09:24.310 --> 00:09:25.310
Saitou...

00:09:29.110 --> 00:09:33.320
Comfort is given
from a superior to an inferior.

00:09:33.320 --> 00:09:36.030
Know your place,
you sub-bottom-of-the-pyramid scum!

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:40.160
<i>Even if you're willing to hide
your embarrassment, you're not being cute.</i>

00:09:41.200 --> 00:09:43.540
All right, all right.
Just stop crying already.

00:09:43.830 --> 00:09:45.620
Shut up, white hair!

00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:50.050
Kamakura, are you sad?

00:09:50.050 --> 00:09:52.050
Yeah, she's just feeling a little down.

00:09:52.630 --> 00:09:55.630
Look, your co-worker is consoling you, too.

00:09:55.630 --> 00:09:56.840
Kamakura...

00:09:57.550 --> 00:09:59.300
...please pay up.

00:09:59.300 --> 00:10:00.760
Translation:
Please cheer up.

00:10:01.180 --> 00:10:03.640
"Paying up" is my problem exactly!

00:10:05.270 --> 00:10:07.650
Thinking,
"She's gotten better! That's the spirit!"

00:10:08.560 --> 00:10:12.070
<i>Why is she so stuck on me?</i>

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:18.990
<i>If I think calmly how everything might go,
I may end up like some of the hosts</i>

00:10:18.990 --> 00:10:22.910
<i>who have an admirer with obsessive affection
and ends up stabbing or killing the host...</i>

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:25.910
What's wrong, Shindou? An order?

00:10:26.370 --> 00:10:27.500
Kill...

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:28.710
Kielbasa?

00:10:28.710 --> 00:10:31.840
Kouno! This might bring me
unhappiness, so you can have it!

00:10:33.670 --> 00:10:37.470
Shindou left with that lottery ticket.

00:10:37.470 --> 00:10:39.510
I wonder what'll happen.

00:10:40.850 --> 00:10:41.720
What?

00:10:41.720 --> 00:10:44.020
Okay, you don't have a fever.

00:10:44.680 --> 00:10:49.060
<i>So even Kisaki
can be considerate for a co-worker...</i>

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:51.310
I wonder what the punchline is.

00:10:51.310 --> 00:10:53.020
What's up, Kouno?

00:10:53.530 --> 00:10:56.740
Oh, Shindou gave me
lottery tickets from last year.

00:10:57.570 --> 00:11:00.660
I didn't think last year's ticket
would have a match.

00:11:00.660 --> 00:11:02.910
I almost panicked the same amount
when I got pregnant.

00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:06.290
I didn't think this would happen.

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:10.250
So at any rate, he can't repay the debt then.

00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:13.250
Sh-Shiho, there you are.

00:11:14.590 --> 00:11:15.630
What do you want?

00:11:15.630 --> 00:11:20.470
Well, about that lottery ticket,
it looks like I dropped it somewhere.

00:11:21.550 --> 00:11:25.470
<i>Yeah. I'm sure she'll pick on me
because I caused so much trouble.</i>

00:11:26.390 --> 00:11:30.270
You liar. There's no way you would lose
something as valuable as that.

00:11:30.270 --> 00:11:31.770
Are you mocking me?

00:11:31.770 --> 00:11:33.440
I-I'm not lying!

00:11:33.770 --> 00:11:39.990
But even if I didn't lose it,
the thought of you brooding over it...

00:11:39.990 --> 00:11:41.570
<i>...and then murdering me...</i>

00:11:41.570 --> 00:11:43.910
...just didn't sit well with me.

00:11:43.910 --> 00:11:47.000
Like they say,
some things are more important than money.

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:48.580
That's why, um...

00:11:48.910 --> 00:11:52.040
You shouldn't fret over it. Cheer up.

00:11:56.420 --> 00:11:57.670
Shiho?

00:11:58.670 --> 00:12:00.760
You really are an idiot.

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:04.140
I'm going home.

00:12:05.560 --> 00:12:10.810
You let all that money slip away.
You're so stupid that I feel sorry for you.

00:12:10.810 --> 00:12:13.650
But I'm kind so I'll reduce
the amount of your debt.

00:12:15.610 --> 00:12:18.570
B-By 500 yen.

00:12:18.570 --> 00:12:20.490
Even 500 yen?

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:26.030
<i>These two have a cheaper relationship
than I thought.</i>

00:12:32.960 --> 00:12:34.080
Higashida!

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:36.420
Please accept my chocolate!

00:12:36.710 --> 00:12:38.050
No thanks.

00:12:38.640 --> 00:12:40.630
All right, work, work...

00:12:41.220 --> 00:12:43.130
He didn't accept it!

00:12:43.130 --> 00:12:44.640
Yes, I saw.

00:12:45.430 --> 00:12:49.350
<i>It's unnatural that he even accepted it
the first few times.</i>

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:52.850
Why won't he eat it?
Do you know, Muranushi?

00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:57.320
I do... but I don't know if you should
hear it from of my mouth.

00:12:58.190 --> 00:13:01.490
But I spent a lot of time
and did my best to make it.

00:13:01.740 --> 00:13:03.200
Sure gets me down...

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:08.240
<i>Higashida refused out of self-preservation,
but I do feel a little sorry for Miyakoshi.</i>

00:13:08.240 --> 00:13:09.790
The day after I gave him chocolate,

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:12.460
I crammed all the leftover ingredients
and some other stuff

00:13:12.460 --> 00:13:15.710
into a pot and cooked it together,
then added some other things...

00:13:15.710 --> 00:13:17.040
<i>Or not...</i>

00:13:17.920 --> 00:13:21.010
So I want to know
what's wrong with this chocolate.

00:13:22.630 --> 00:13:29.560
Chocolate... For reference,
I bought some chocolate for Kouno,

00:13:29.560 --> 00:13:32.600
but it looked so good,
I ended up eating it all myself.

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:34.730
What?

00:13:34.730 --> 00:13:37.110
<i>I have no idea how that's of any relevance.</i>

00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:39.980
Come to think of it,
I haven't gotten anything in return.

00:13:40.150 --> 00:13:41.570
You won't be getting anything.

00:13:43.110 --> 00:13:47.320
Even though you wanted to give me chocolate,
you didn't get anything from me in return?

00:13:47.570 --> 00:13:51.410
You can't do that. You have to make good.

00:13:51.410 --> 00:13:55.170
You're saying mysterious things,
but I can't play along so suddenly, Miri.

00:13:56.580 --> 00:13:58.960
That curry will do. Can I have it?

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:00.670
Seriously?

00:14:00.670 --> 00:14:02.960
I mean, you're satisfied with this?
I don't mind or anything.

00:14:03.510 --> 00:14:05.880
So she's pushing with a strong attitude?

00:14:05.880 --> 00:14:09.140
Or maybe she just wanted to eat curry.

00:14:10.010 --> 00:14:11.430
Higashida!

00:14:12.060 --> 00:14:12.770
Bump.

00:14:14.230 --> 00:14:18.310
If you don't eat this chocolate,
I'm gonna toss it away, you bastard!

00:14:18.560 --> 00:14:19.980
Is that right?

00:14:19.980 --> 00:14:23.230
In that case, I have no choice.
I'll call the police.

00:14:23.440 --> 00:14:24.780
Don't threaten me!

00:14:25.150 --> 00:14:26.360
Likewise.

00:14:28.110 --> 00:14:32.290
What should I do?
Wait here until Higashida's shift is over?

00:14:32.660 --> 00:14:34.700
But the mood he's in...

00:14:36.160 --> 00:14:41.000
But if I had someone else eat it and they
changed like Higashida did, it'd be even worse.

00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:45.590
Jeez, if I had the current Higashida's
toughness and brains like him,

00:14:45.590 --> 00:14:47.880
I'd probably come up with a solution.

00:14:47.880 --> 00:14:49.970
Like the current Higashida...

00:14:51.930 --> 00:14:54.100
<i>I ended up eating it all myself.</i>

00:14:54.470 --> 00:14:56.100
If I eat this...

00:14:59.440 --> 00:15:05.530
Um, Higashida, I know how you feel,
but please don't be so cold to Miyakoshi.

00:15:05.860 --> 00:15:08.110
I feel sorry for her if she's brooding over it.

00:15:08.450 --> 00:15:09.700
Brooding?

00:15:10.320 --> 00:15:11.620
Miyakoshi?

00:15:11.620 --> 00:15:16.290
What if she gets so deep in brooding,
that she eats her own chocolate?

00:15:16.660 --> 00:15:17.660
Or something.

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:20.790
Miyakoshi!

00:15:25.340 --> 00:15:26.340
Higashida...

00:15:26.340 --> 00:15:27.590
Miyakoshi...

00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:33.510
Higashida... I'm sorry...

00:15:38.980 --> 00:15:40.600
Miyakoshi!

00:15:41.650 --> 00:15:44.750
Nooo!

00:15:49.070 --> 00:15:51.780
<i>It sounds like the three of them are having fun.</i>

00:15:52.240 --> 00:15:55.490
Miyakoshi, wake up. Miyakoshi!

00:16:12.220 --> 00:16:14.890
<i>Huh? Oh, that's right.</i>

00:16:14.890 --> 00:16:17.350
<i>I ate the chocolate and passed out.</i>

00:16:18.680 --> 00:16:22.190
<i>Jeez, I've never had anything like that
in my life.</i>

00:16:22.190 --> 00:16:23.190
<i>Higashida!</i>

00:16:25.610 --> 00:16:29.530
<i>Nice to meet you, Hana Miyakoshi.
I'm Valentine.</i>

00:16:30.530 --> 00:16:34.200
<i>It's off-season, so I don't have much power
and I'm small, but...</i>

00:16:36.990 --> 00:16:38.370
<i>What was that for?</i>

00:16:38.370 --> 00:16:40.960
<i>I was thinking how lifelike you are.</i>

00:16:40.960 --> 00:16:42.250
<i>I'm not a toy!</i>

00:16:42.250 --> 00:16:46.670
<i>And even if I were,
there's no need to strike me! Sheesh!</i>

00:16:47.210 --> 00:16:49.300
<i>So, what are you, old man?</i>

00:16:49.760 --> 00:16:56.050
<i>Um... Usually I secretly advocate
love and peace around Valentine's Day...</i>

00:16:56.050 --> 00:17:00.810
<i>...but I suppose you could say the power
of your chocolate has materialized me.</i>

00:17:01.890 --> 00:17:05.110
<i>In other words, I'm your... son.</i>

00:17:08.070 --> 00:17:09.440
What should we do?

00:17:09.440 --> 00:17:11.400
I know we need to stay calm...

00:17:11.400 --> 00:17:15.570
When this happened to you,
you woke up after having a nightmare.

00:17:16.240 --> 00:17:18.700
<i>Maybe she's with him...</i>

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:22.290
<i>It is off-season though, so if she gets lost...</i>

00:17:22.910 --> 00:17:24.250
<i>I have to bring her back.</i>

00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:26.290
H-Higashida?

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:29.750
<i>You're terrible, Daisuke!</i>

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:35.050
<i>I'm going to skip several steps, but how could
you go out with me when you were married?</i>

00:17:35.300 --> 00:17:37.720
<i>It's a misunderstanding! Listen to me!</i>

00:17:37.720 --> 00:17:40.180
<i>No! I can't live like this! I'm going to die!</i>

00:17:40.770 --> 00:17:41.560
<i>Chomp!</i>

00:17:42.480 --> 00:17:43.480
<i>Hana!</i>

00:17:45.310 --> 00:17:50.860
<i>Abridged misunderstanding aside,
it's my fault that Hana has died.</i>

00:17:50.860 --> 00:17:56.070
<i>I'll chase right after you, so let's be happy
together in Heaven. I'm sorry, Hana!</i>

00:17:56.530 --> 00:18:00.330
<i>And so, at the end of love and hate,
the two lovers committed suicide.</i>

00:18:00.330 --> 00:18:02.750
<i>Only his wife, Naga, was left behind...</i>

00:18:02.750 --> 00:18:03.870
No way!

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:14.970
<i>I'm here... but can I actually
look for her, and find her?</i>

00:18:14.970 --> 00:18:17.430
<i>M-Miyakoshi? Hey...</i>

00:18:18.390 --> 00:18:19.470
<i>Higashida!</i>

00:18:19.470 --> 00:18:21.930
<i>Sob-sob...</i>

00:18:20.060 --> 00:18:20.850
<i>Miyakosh—</i>

00:18:22.270 --> 00:18:24.890
<i>What are you doing? Don't make a deity cry!</i>

00:18:24.890 --> 00:18:28.100
<i>Sob-sob-sob-sob...</i>

00:18:25.560 --> 00:18:28.100
<i>Higashida, you know this old man?</i>

00:18:28.100 --> 00:18:32.650
<i>Know him? Every time I eat your chocolate,
I'm brought here.</i>

00:18:28.100 --> 00:18:32.650
<i>Sob-sob-sob-sob...</i>

00:18:32.650 --> 00:18:37.570
<i>Sob-sob-sob-sob...</i>

00:18:33.110 --> 00:18:35.450
<i>So what are you doing here, Higashida?</i>

00:18:35.450 --> 00:18:37.570
<i>I came to pick you up.</i>

00:18:37.570 --> 00:18:40.530
<i>After all, in some part this may be my fault.</i>

00:18:37.570 --> 00:18:40.530
<i>Sob-sob-sob-sob...</i>

00:18:40.530 --> 00:18:47.170
<i>Sob-sob-sob-sob...</i>

00:18:40.950 --> 00:18:43.160
<i>You not only ate that stuff every time,</i>

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:47.170
<i>but this time you consumed it willingly
to come here for my sake?</i>

00:18:47.170 --> 00:18:50.130
<i>Sob-sob-sob-sob...</i>

00:18:47.750 --> 00:18:50.130
<i>Yeah, I'm not sure why.</i>

00:18:50.130 --> 00:18:55.050
<i>Sob-sob-sob-sob...</i>

00:18:53.380 --> 00:18:54.510
<i>Are you all right?</i>

00:18:55.970 --> 00:18:57.630
<i>This girl is so violent.</i>

00:18:58.390 --> 00:19:00.140
<i>I apologize, Higashida.</i>

00:19:00.140 --> 00:19:04.720
<i>I said that if love blossomed between you two,
her cooking would probably become delicious.</i>

00:19:04.720 --> 00:19:06.980
<i>I even told you to love her with all your heart.</i>

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:11.690
<i>Don't say unnecessary things.</i>

00:19:11.900 --> 00:19:14.780
<i>Y-You should both be getting back home, yes!</i>

00:19:14.780 --> 00:19:16.110
<i>Well, goodbye!</i>

00:19:16.110 --> 00:19:17.650
<i>Bastard!</i>

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:21.870
Neither one of them are waking up.

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:25.200
Maybe they're not going to.

00:19:25.830 --> 00:19:29.960
Naga... This is the end,
so why don't you tell him how you feel?

00:19:36.050 --> 00:19:41.470
H-Higashida...
I've always had feelings for you...

00:19:41.470 --> 00:19:43.560
- He's running off?
- I'm sorry!

00:19:44.180 --> 00:19:46.730
I mean, thank goodness you woke up!

00:19:46.730 --> 00:19:50.600
Nagata? Then I'm back?

00:19:50.600 --> 00:19:54.110
I was so, so worried...

00:19:55.070 --> 00:19:56.440
...for both of you.

00:19:56.440 --> 00:19:58.530
Whoa, that was surprising.

00:19:58.740 --> 00:19:59.740
I'm exhausted.

00:20:00.610 --> 00:20:01.990
Both of you, sit up now!

00:20:04.280 --> 00:20:06.540
Do you know how worried I've been?

00:20:06.910 --> 00:20:08.580
You need to value your lives more!

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:10.120
Sorry...

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:12.830
Think about the people you left behind!

00:20:13.170 --> 00:20:15.340
Haha, you're getting yelled at.

00:20:15.710 --> 00:20:19.090
And Yanagiba,
stop eating curry and come to school!

00:20:24.180 --> 00:20:25.970
<i>I'm super tired.</i>

00:20:25.970 --> 00:20:30.190
<i>Not only from the chocolate,
but Nagata's three-hour scolding...</i>

00:20:32.730 --> 00:20:37.570
<i>Anyway, I wanted to ask Miyakoshi
what she thinks about that love stuff</i>

00:20:38.110 --> 00:20:41.990
<i>and whether she's going to continue cooking,
and everything...</i>

00:20:43.740 --> 00:20:46.490
Hana Miyakoshi received her
first scolding from a customer

00:20:47.290 --> 00:20:49.950
<i>Well, guess I'll let it go for today.</i>

00:21:02.010 --> 00:21:03.090
Miyakoshi.

00:21:03.840 --> 00:21:05.350
Are you feeling all right?

00:21:05.890 --> 00:21:07.810
Yeah! I'm fine!

00:21:11.480 --> 00:21:12.560
Are you sure...

00:21:13.140 --> 00:21:14.560
I'm fine! I'm fine!

00:21:18.150 --> 00:21:20.030
Is she really okay?

00:21:20.030 --> 00:21:22.450
You're a nice guy, Higashida.

00:21:22.450 --> 00:21:24.450
Even after she puts you through a lot.

00:21:24.860 --> 00:21:28.740
Well, she passed out last time,
so I'm a little worried.

00:21:28.740 --> 00:21:29.830
Yuuta!

00:21:31.790 --> 00:21:33.290
Sh-Shiho.

00:21:33.290 --> 00:21:35.540
As always, you've got a pathetic voice.

00:21:35.540 --> 00:21:38.340
Would you not say my name with that voice?

00:21:38.590 --> 00:21:39.340
I'm sorry.

00:21:39.340 --> 00:21:41.550
Eat this and repent.

00:21:42.090 --> 00:21:43.630
It isn't dog food!

00:21:44.130 --> 00:21:47.390
Anyone who would be this pleased about it
really is a base creature.

00:23:26.030 --> 00:23:36.040
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

00:23:26.570 --> 00:23:30.370
So I've heard children and animals
can communicate, so let's see.

00:23:30.370 --> 00:23:33.540
Mr. Raccoon, I hear your species was
named "raccoon dog" because people
used to think dogs evolved from you.

00:23:31.280 --> 00:23:33.540
We can even become jackals or wolves!

00:23:32.740 --> 00:23:33.910
It seems they are communicating.

00:23:33.540 --> 00:23:36.040
FUNNY STORY

00:23:33.910 --> 00:23:35.620
Next time, "Funny Story."
